      <data key="d2">统计客户订购的增值服务总数，反映客户业务粘性与迁移成本以辅助流失预测</data>
      <data key="d15">包含各增值服务开通状态（如'是'）列的 DataFrame</data>
      <data key="d16">新增 n_services 统计列的 DataFrame</data>
      <data key="d11">{"service_cols": ["online_security", "tech_support", "streaming_tv"]}</data>
      <data key="d17">extracted</data>
      <data key="d18">False</data>
      <data key="d19">def count_services(df, service_cols=("online_security", "tech_support", "streaming_tv")):
    """统计客户订购的增值服务数量；订购越多，迁移成本越高，流失率越低。"""
    out = df.copy()
    out["n_services"] = sum((out[c] == "是").astype(int) for c in service_cols if c in out.columns)
    return out</data>
    </node>
